  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c760a53ec001ab4ee6d8a221d02514381eddfe5cb877cbee2875640d5f263620",
      "text": "手机最新机型广告的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e8f450ca70be7702dd8161d106f4b6c7eca48721e73cbf760419168c6f55f72",
      "text": "手机最新机型的广告？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0827b24d5812e907a323b2c540a960dc68a63b46e8a01026532466172d5c179f",
      "text": "是的！对方发来邀约，\n说务必请恭二先生来出演。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3776cc17413835e95bf5940fcf9f152b5a9d5db16394445850a660bc5b76989f",
      "text": "这份是这次出演广告的\n资料。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7011a6e506e300dac3bf95fb937e871cea72445e4914736a88244d95227b0f14",
      "text": "谢了。……嘿，规格很不错嘛。\n颜色也有好几种吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1c01018826daba62f49b8a39286f0737064dcce5b0e9c135dd944ab6d186f2c",
      "text": "外观设计也挺好的，感觉会很受欢迎。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a329224ee23f41bf584c2b50e900b0a95a2240c31a9c0de76e22c0585215ddf9",
      "text": "手机也是每次出最新机型\n都会增加新功能，挺有意思的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cf784172b7dad7d158056bea7c1b5f142a09f85cc3cf58bc2441550589ecf0c",
      "text": "广告好像主要是以介绍新功能为主吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c33bceaf14e2f960829164174eae32f51c3fed3c01d0cf1dbe212915652e8981",
      "text": "嗯。虽然不能外借，\n但据说下次开会的时候可以让我们上手体验。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6ff187217470b12670e73c3962b67d753a48d05ec30b1549f7b3d73350483f6",
      "text": "对方这次对这个广告也相当重视。\n为了传达出商品的魅力，一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a74ecb1c6c5cc6e0e54fb8a3d168548136b487ed7be1190eb4ccf6db10f71c1",
      "text": "嗯，既然选了我，\n我就会竭尽所能的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
